							"provenance": "representative",
							"note": "Mean Well NGE12 05-USB (12 W wall adapter with a USB Type-A output, the 5 V model of the NGE12 series), SPECIFICATION p. 2: DC voltage 5 V, voltage tolerance +/-5.0%."
